ss+ Plan or (ii) your Pro Plan to a Business+ Plan, in either event, at the time of redemption. However, if you had a paid Slack plan within the last 30 days before trying to redeem this offer, you will not be eligible to apply this discount to the same plan type (i.e., Pro or Business+) that you previously had.  For more information on Slack\u2019s plans and features, see <plansAndFeaturesLink>here</plansAndFeaturesLink>. This {discountPercent}% discount will only apply for the first 12 months from the date of your plan upgrade, whether billed annually or monthly (the <strong>\u201CDiscount Period\u201D</strong>). To redeem this offer, make sure you have a Slack workspace (if you don\u2019t have one, you can <createWorkspaceLink>create a Slack workspace</createWorkspaceLink>) and then click the \u201CGet {discountPercent}% Off Slack\u201D button above and follow the steps to complete the purchase of your upgrade, or, if you have an existing Slack Pro Plan payable by invoice, please <contactSalesLink>contact our Sales team</contactSalesLink>. This offer does not apply to companies with more than 200 employees or to upgrades to Slack\u2019s Enterprise Grid Plan. If you have more than 200 employees or if you are interested in the Enterprise Grid Plan, you can <contactSalesLink>contact our Sales team</contactSalesLink> for more information.",{discountPercent:i},({text:e,tag:t})=>{switch(t){case"plansAndFeaturesLink":return renderPlansAndFeaturesLink(e);case"createWorkspaceLink":return(0,a.jsx)(o.A,{href:s?`${C.getStartedWithoutHash}?entry_point=${s}#/`:C.getStarted,target:"_blank",autoClogProps:S,children:e});case"contactSalesLink":return renderContactSalesLink(e);case"strong":return(0,a.jsx)("strong",{children:e});default:return""}})}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:b.rt("By redeeming this offer, you agree that these offer terms form part of and modify Slack\u2019s <termsOfServiceLink>Customer Terms of Service</termsOfServiceLink> (or the terms of your written agreement regarding your use of Slack\u2019s services) (your <strong>\u201CAgreement\u201D</strong>) entered into between you and the Slack entity identified in the Agreement. You further agree that, after the Discount Period, Slack\u2019s then-current standard pricing set forth on Slack\u2019s <plansPageLink>Pricing Page</plansPageLink> will apply, including to all or part of any plan renewals. For clarity, after the 12 month Discount Period, if you continue with your upgraded plan, you will be charged at the standard rate for the plan you have selected unless you cancel your subscription. If you redeem this offer and then cancel your paid Slack plan or downgrade to a free plan during the Discount Period, this offer will no longer be available to you.",null,({text:e,tag:t})=>{switch(t){case"termsOfServiceLink":return renderTermsOfServiceLink(e);case"plansPageLink":return renderPlansPageLink(e);case"strong":return(0,a.jsx)("strong",{children:e});default:return""}})}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:b.t("This offer cannot be combined with any other offer.  Limit one offer redemption per customer. Offer is non-transferable. This offer is available for a limited time only, and Slack may end or modify this offer at any time without notice to you.")})]});else if(e===h.eM.smart_discount)L=(0,a.jsxs)(a.Fragment,{children:[(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:b.rt("To redeem this offer, you must upgrade from the free version of Slack to a monthly Pro or Business+ plan by the date listed in the offer you received from Slack. For more information on Slack\u2019s plans and features, see <plansAndFeaturesLink>here</plansAndFeaturesLink>. This {discountOfferPercent}% discount will only apply for the first {discountDuration, plural, =1 {month} other {# months}} from the date of your upgraded plan (the \u201C<strong>Discount Period</strong>\u201D). Additional information can be found in <billingFAQLink>Slack\u2019s billing FAQs</billingFAQLink>. This offer does not apply to annual plans or to upgrades to Slack\u201